{
  "id": "hydraulic_pump_motor_sizing",
  "title": "Hydraulic Pump Motor Sizing",
  "description": "Motor size vs. flow rate, shaft torque, shaft power and hydraulic power.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Hydraulic Pump Motor Sizing\n\nCalculate flow rate, shaft torque, shaft power, and hydraulic power based on pump displacement, pressure, and rotational speed.\n\n### Equations\n\n**Flow Rate:**\n- Q = D × n / 1000\n- Q = flow rate (l/min), D = displacement (cm³/rev), n = revolutions (rpm)\n\n**Shaft Torque:**\n- T = D × p / (20 × π)\n- T = torque (Nm), p = pressure (bar)\n\n**Shaft Power:**\n- P_s = T × n / 9554\n- P_s = shaft power (kW)\n\n**Hydraulic Power:**\n- P_h = Q × p / 600\n- P_h = hydraulic power (kW)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "displacement",
          "label": "Piston Displacement",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "cm³/rev",
          "defaultValue": 50
        },
        {
          "id": "revolutions",
          "label": "Revolutions",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "rpm",
          "defaultValue": 1500
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure",
          "label": "Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "bar",
          "defaultValue": 200
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "flow_rate",
          "label": "Flow Rate",
          "formula": "inputs.displacement * inputs.revolutions / 1000",
          "unit": "l/min",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "shaft_torque",
          "label": "Shaft Torque",
          "formula": "inputs.displacement * inputs.pressure / (20 * 3.14159265359)",
          "unit": "Nm",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "shaft_power",
          "label": "Shaft Power",
          "formula": "(inputs.displacement * inputs.pressure / (20 * 3.14159265359)) * inputs.revolutions / 9554",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "hydraulic_power",
          "label": "Hydraulic Power",
          "formula": "(inputs.displacement * inputs.revolutions / 1000) * inputs.pressure / 600",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}